1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,594
Khet mein sarson hai, par munafa nahi.

2
00:00:02,894 --> 00:00:08,660
Dinesh, sarson ke phool pe madhumakkhi paalo! Shahad bhi, aur fasal bhi zyada!

3
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:11,471
Madhumakkhi? Chacha, wo to kaat lengi!

4
00:00:11,771 --> 00:00:18,186
Training lo, jaali pehno, kuch nahi hoga. 50 box, lagbhag 2 lakh. Subsidy bhi hai.

5
00:00:18,486 --> 00:00:25,482
Phoolon ke mausam ke hisaab se box ghumao. Sarson, litchi, surajmukhi, har phool ka alag shahad.

6
00:00:26,032 --> 00:00:29,895
Dinesh, mujhe shuddh shahad chahiye. Milawat wala nahi!

7
00:00:30,195 --> 00:00:33,326
Seedha chhatte se, Vaidya ji. 400 rupaye kilo!

8
00:00:33,626 --> 00:00:38,966
Ek box se saal mein 25 kilo. 50 box, saal ke 3 lakh se upar.

9
00:00:39,266 --> 00:00:45,031
Apna brand bana, jaar pe naam chhapwa. Aur online bech, daam zyada milega.

10
00:00:45,331 --> 00:00:48,437
Zindagi mein mithaas aa gayi! Dinesh ki life set!
